    "Faden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden ${question} fragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask Faden ${question}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden baut aus euren Gesprächen einen Wissensgraphen: Dinge und ihre Beziehungen, statt loser Notizen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden builds a knowledge graph out of your conversations: things and their relationships, rather than loose notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden bringt kein Modell und keinen Suchanbieter mit. Trage deinen Endpoint, deinen Key und den Modellnamen ein — alles bleibt auf diesem Gerät.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden brings no model and no search provider with it. Enter your endpoint, your key and the model name — all of it stays on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden fragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask Faden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden schreibt weiter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden keeps writing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fasst den älteren Verlauf im Hintergrund zusammen, sobald die Schwelle erreicht ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarises the older history in the background once the threshold is reached."
          }
        }
      }
    },
